HC_BeatenText_A2_0:
	text "Oh. Ow. That's a"
	line "new feeling. I'll"
	para "write a poem about"
	line "it."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_1:
	text "You win. Take a"
	line "berry. Take all"
	para "the berries."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_2:
	text "I accept this"
	line "defeat radically."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_3:
	text "My feelings are"
	line "hurt. And my ribs."
	para "Mostly the ribs."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_4:
	text "I have no hard"
	line "feelings. I have a"
	para "lot of soft ones."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_5:
	text "Fine. You win. We"
	line "share everything"
	para "here, and now that"
	line "includes the loss."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_6:
	text "I'll go meditate."
	line "Or cry. Possibly"
	para "both. Possibly in"
	line "a tree."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_7:
	text "You hit like a"
	line "landlord. I"
	para "thought we'd"
	line "escaped those."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_8:
	text "Please be gentle"
	line "with the bodies."
	para "They've got"
	line "feelings. Or at"
	para "least pollen."
