HC_BeatenText_A2_12:
	text "Aaah! My aura! My"
	line "other aura!"
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_13:
	text "I forgive you in"
	line "advance. And also"
	para "after. And during."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_14:
	text "Take what you"
	line "need. We never"
	para "lock anything."
	line "You'll understand"
	para "soon."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_15:
	text "Whoa. Heavy. Real"
	line "heavy, man. Like,"
	para "structurally"
	line "heavy."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_16:
	text "Is that how it's"
	line "done out there?"
	para "Out there is"
	line "terrible."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_17:
	text "I was a banker. I"
	line "feel so much"
	para "better being"
	line "beaten."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_18:
	text "The forest heard"
	line "that. The forest"
	para "is judging you,"
	line "too."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_19:
	text "I have wounded"
	line "pride, a wounded"
	para "team and a very"
	line "exposed back. Be"
	para "kind."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_20:
	text "That's the third"
	line "time I've been"
	para "fainted this week."
	line "Hey, it's honest"
	para "work."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_21:
	text "Well. That's one"
	line "way to open a"
	para "chakra."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_22:
	text "Yes! Yes! More!"
	line "Wait, no, I'm"
	para "kidding. Stop."
	line "Seriously."
	done

HC_BeatenText_A2_23:
	text "That wasn't a fair"
	line "fight. It was an"
	para "honest one, which"
	line "is worse."
